[
  {
    "id": "fr-noun",
    "title": "名词",
    "items": [
      {
        "id": "fr-noun-gender",
        "title": "性与数",
        "tables": [
          {
            "caption": "名词的性与数",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "",
              "单数",
              "复数"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "阳性",
                "<bdi>le livre</bdi>",
                "<bdi>les livres</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "阴性",
                "<bdi>la table</bdi>",
                "<bdi>les tables</bdi>"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "caption": "常见复数规则",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "单数结尾",
              "复数规则",
              "例"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "一般",
                "<bdi>+ -s</bdi>",
                "<bdi>livre → livres</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "<bdi>-s, -x, -z</bdi>",
                "不变",
                "<bdi>voix → voix, nez → nez</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "<bdi>-al</bdi>",
                "<bdi>-al → -aux</bdi>",
                "<bdi>cheval → chevaux</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "<bdi>-eau, -au, -eu</bdi>",
                "<bdi>+ -x</bdi>",
                "<bdi>beau → beaux, feu → feux</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "-<bdi>ou</bdi>（部分）",
                "<bdi>+ -x</bdi>",
                "<bdi>bijou → bijoux, genou → genoux</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "-<bdi>ail</bdi>（部分）",
                "<bdi>-ail → -aux</bdi>",
                "<bdi>travail → travaux</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "-<bdi>s / -x / -z</bdi> 结尾",
                "不变",
                "<bdi>fils → fils</bdi>"
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        "notes": "法语名词的性别需按词记忆：以 -<bdi>tion / -té / -ette / -elle / -ance / -ence</bdi> 结尾多为阴性，以 <bdi>-ment / -age / -isme / -eau</bdi> 结尾多为阳性。"
      },
      {
